# GMS gives this 150+2x% four times on eight enemies, and gives Phase Dash
# 320+5x% twice on the same eight -- 760% against 840% at master, off a swing
# 270ms shorter. Phase Dash is simply the better skill, and two buttons where
# one is strictly worse is not a choice.
#
# So the two are one skill here: Midnight Carnival's four lines carrying Phase
# Dash's total. 750ms is Midnight Carnival's own, from the frame data.
